                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.6363/114: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Davis</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-13T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 13, 1922—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Your 18, May 8, 9 A.M.</p>
                <p>You may make representations in accordance with Department’s 7, May 5, 3 P.M.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
